      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's a good idea and I thought about it a couple of years ago. However, the VR-equipment has not yet reached the level where learning via VR is convenient. The screen resolution of VR-headsets is not high enough to comfortably read text. VR-gloves with feedback are monstrously expensive and are not a product of mass use. Therefore, at the moment, online learning is more convenient with standard methods. However, this direction is definitely worth developing, because in the future, the characteristics of VR-equipment will improve. The developers of VR-Chat need to add the SDK-tools for online learning. In the meantime, you can use this school for classes:\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_104c607b-f246-42fa-91c7-448c4cd0031d\n:-))",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
